        "buy_acc_1": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Description",
            "content": "<p>ALTAÏ Second Wind is a liquid dietary supplement for adult men. It combines botanical extracts and minerals in a dropper format—a simple option if you prefer not to swallow capsules.</p><p>The formula includes Tongkat Ali, Shilajit, Fadogia agrestis, Ashwagandha, magnesium, zinc, Ajuga turkestanica, boron citrate, and a botanical blend.</p><p>The liquid base contains organic glycerin, purified water, citric acid, and natural flavors. See the Supplement Facts section for the amounts and full ingredient list.</p>",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "buy_acc_2": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Why Take ALTAÏ?",
            "content": "<p>Low desire, low energy and stress don’t stay at the office. They follow you into the bedroom. ALTAÏ is a daily formula built to support what matters there: healthy libido, stamina, testosterone levels and a calmer mind*.</p><p>It’s not a pill you time an hour before sex. One dropper every morning, and the ingredients work with your body over days and weeks*. Nothing to plan, nothing to hide, nothing to explain.</p>",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "buy_acc_3": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Benefits",
            "content": "<p><strong>Desire & libido:</strong> Tongkat Ali and Fadogia agrestis, traditionally used for male vigor, to support a healthy libido*.</p><p><strong>Healthy testosterone:</strong> Tongkat Ali, Shilajit, Ashwagandha and zinc to support healthy testosterone levels*.</p><p><strong>Stamina & energy:</strong> Shilajit and magnesium to support natural energy, so the day doesn’t take everything you’ve got*.</p><p><strong>Less stress, more presence:</strong> Ashwagandha helps your body manage everyday stress, one of the biggest mood-killers in the bedroom*.</p>",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "buy_acc_4": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Recommended Use",
            "content": "<p>ALTAÏ is taken under the tongue using the included dropper. Follow the directions on your bottle for the serving size and frequency. Do not exceed the recommended amount.</p><p>Each 60 mL bottle contains 30 servings of 2 mL. At one serving per day, that would be a 30-day supply. Always follow the usage directions on your bottle.</p>",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "buy_acc_5": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How Do I Know These Are Made With Premium Ingredients?",
            "content": "<p>Every batch is third-party lab tested for purity and potency. Made in a GMP-certified facility in the USA. No artificial fillers, no proprietary blends hiding weak doses. Every ingredient is listed at its actual amount so you know exactly what you're putting in your body.</p>",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "buy_acc_6": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "90-Day Money Back Guarantee",
            "content": "<p>ALTAÏ comes with a 90-day money-back guarantee. Please review the guarantee terms for eligibility, any return requirements, and how to request a refund.</p><p>We offer fast, reliable shipping: most orders arrive within 5–7 business days, depending on your location.</p><p>Need help? Our support team is here for any questions about your order.</p>",
